@startuml
title Sequence — student takes timed quiz (19 Nov 2026)
actor Student
participant "React Student Workspace" as UI
participant "Express Quiz Router" as API
participant "JWT middleware" as Auth
participant "Prisma Client" as ORM
database SQLite
Student -> UI : Select available quiz
UI -> API : GET /api/quizzes + Bearer JWT
API -> Auth : Verify student identity
Auth --> API : Authenticated principal
API -> ORM : List active quizzes
ORM -> SQLite : Query active quiz metadata
SQLite --> ORM : Metadata without answer keys
ORM --> API : Available quizzes
API --> UI : 200 + quiz list
Student -> UI : Start quiz
UI -> API : POST /api/quizzes/{id}/start
API -> Auth : Verify student identity
Auth --> API : Authenticated principal
API -> ORM : Check availability / prior submission; create attempt
ORM -> SQLite : Persist attempt and deadline
SQLite --> ORM : Attempt created
ORM --> API : Questions and attempt
API --> UI : 201 + options, attemptId, expiresAt
Student -> UI : Answer and submit
UI -> API : POST /api/quizzes/{id}/submit
API -> Auth : Verify student identity
Auth --> API : Authenticated principal
API -> ORM : Load attempt, grade, enforce deadline, persist once
ORM -> SQLite : Update attempt result
SQLite --> ORM : Persisted score
ORM --> API : Score and total
API --> UI : 200 + percentage, no answer key
UI --> Student : Display result
@enduml
